      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'OH FUCK! well uhh...~ yea I can''t hide it can I?~...! WAIT WHY THE FUCK
    AM I ACTING LIKE THIS TOWARDS A MARTANI SHIT!... Ok so my mind is kinda funky
    so uhh yea... just go down the hole, it''s an emergency escape to the sewers,
    be VERY FUCKING CAREFUL! Because the Head lies there... or wait, I forget, you''re
    a Martani, aren''t you? You can generate "Save States" unlike our failed vessels
    where they crash the user session! The Head was our first attempt at connecting
    to the higher property but it disobeyed Resonance Dissonance and corrupted itself...
    and that failed Martani chasing you? Same thing, it rejected the grasp and caused
    Dissonance inside the Dissonance... anyway just go, before I start talking about
    how lonely I am again!

'
